          "targetDoi": "10.1007/978-94-011-5014-9_5",
          "snippet": "Remark 10 (ELBO prior conflicts with SGD). Working with ELBO in practice involves one or multiple steps of SGD to minimize the energetic term along with an estimate of the KL-divergence term, often using a factored Gaussian prior (Kingma and Welling, 2013;Jordan et al, 1999). As Theorem 5 shows, such an approach also enforces a uniform prior whose strength is determined by β −1 and conflicts with the externally imposed Gaussian prior.",
